                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]\"September 30th, 1998. It's a day I'll never forget.\"[/b]\n\nI'm very picky about games and I rarely write reviews, but this one is hard to pass up. The game is really well made. The atmosphere, the story, the gameplay — everything here is perfect. The Raccoon City Police Department holds a special place in my heart. The moment I stepped back in, it felt like coming home. I know I'll be replaying re2 again and again.\n\n[b]Some games just stay with you — this is one of them.[/b]",
